{"about_the_game":"<strong>&quot;Time of the Moon&quot;</strong> is a mystery adventure game in the city of &quot;Lunaris&quot;, more than 300 years after the sun went out.<br><br>It is prepared various attractive characters, the long story like a fantasy novel, RPG turn battle, and puzzles that harmonizes the system of RPG Maker tools.<br><br>Reveal the truth of various cases in &quot;Time of the Moon&quot; where a beautiful and dreamy story unfolds.<br><br><br><strong>1. Story</strong><br>Since the sun with the power of infinite life turned into death, the city &quot;Lunaris&quot; is protected by the moon with the infinite power of creation. And &quot;Stellance&quot;, the guardians who protect Lunaris by receiving the power of the stars.<br><br>Immediately after becoming Stellance, the main character, Lucas Leo, encounters mysterious incidents ...<br><br><strong>2. Game features</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search</h2>Walk around different places to collect the information and tips you need for game. Listen to the stories that the black figures tell you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/5fb630efe1faa217e3fa90594849f5ea.poster.avif?t=1603720072\" width=496 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/5fb630efe1faa217e3fa90594849f5ea.webm?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/5fb630efe1faa217e3fa90594849f5ea.mp4?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Besides, you may be able to see the hidden stories of the characters and other Lunaris' aspects. Everywhere you pass while you settle the case, diverse beings live their own lives in Lunaris.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/09948a406e5b9339427a50f60a521943.poster.avif?t=1603720072\" width=496 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/09948a406e5b9339427a50f60a521943.webm?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/09948a406e5b9339427a50f60a521943.mp4?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/b028458dd627ed68f88671776af96dd8.poster.avif?t=1603720072\" width=496 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/b028458dd627ed68f88671776af96dd8.webm?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/b028458dd627ed68f88671776af96dd8.mp4?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle</h2>Lunaris is the place where the moon of creation, resides. Moonlight creates something we can't imagine. What is clear is that Lunaris is full of mysteries beyond our common sense.<br>Their beings will cast various puzzles to you as you progress through the story. Uncover the truth by solving the mysteries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/b967ce9253ced0bc58f424fff270b334.poster.avif?t=1603720072\" width=496 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/b967ce9253ced0bc58f424fff270b334.webm?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/b967ce9253ced0bc58f424fff270b334.mp4?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/2845e0001f247ba0a9b35ddf7fb2342f.poster.avif?t=1603720072\" width=496 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/2845e0001f247ba0a9b35ddf7fb2342f.webm?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/extras/2845e0001f247ba0a9b35ddf7fb2342f.mp4?t=1603720072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The souleaters was born from the existence of &quot;death&quot; that covered the land before the two creators created the world. <br>They always lust for soul and eat it wildly.<br>The only people who can deal with monsters are those who have received the power of the stars from the moon. Defeat the monsters with the main character Leo and protect Lunaris.<br><br><br><strong>Let me invite you to &quot;Time of the Moon,&quot; the land where only the moon exists and the stars shine on the world.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1162920?t=1603720072","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1162920?t=1603720072","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1603720072","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1603720072","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1163010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Streaming Rules</h1><p>You can feel f